The **Shady Teacher** is new to the school but seems to be
knowledgeable enough. Yet there's something...off about him. Maybe
it's because he wears sunglasses even indoors or that students are
suspiciously disappearing from his class... *Art of Invisibility +2,
Perceptive +2, Smart +3; Absent-Minded −1, Fussy −1, Quirk (Always
Wears Sunglasses) −1, Secret (To Everybody) −2.*

The **Snobbish Upperclassman** is the school's academic darling, the
kendo team's star athlete, and easily the most popular girl on
campus -- and she knows it. You'd be lucky if she gave you the time of
day...or honored you by allowing you to tell it to her. *Agile +2,
Beautiful +2, Knowledge (Kendo) +2, Minions (Her Clique) +2, Quick +2,
Smart +2; Arrogant −2, Emotionless −1, Obsession (Meeting Her Mother's
Lofty Expectations) −2, Overconfident −2, Short-Tempered −1.*

